==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start by spamming [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to stall the enemies while upgrading the Cat Wallet a couple of times and saving your money. When Sir Seal is nearing your base, send out [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]]. After that, keep spamming [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|Meatshields]], [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cats]], and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]]. One you hit the enemy base, Kang Roos will give you a lot of money, so spend it on more Mythical Titan Cats and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]].

